Material Symbols

The Rashin app draws Material Symbols by Google
(https://github.com/google/material-design-icons), the Sharp style at weight
400, taken from the official SVGs at commit 10ecc147 through Lithic's symbols
package. The path data is converted to IconVG; the shapes are otherwise
unchanged.

